---
// Native <dialog> modals: $0 Broadsheet Subscription (RSS live today, email coming soon)
// & Public-Record Tip Line (coming soon)
---

<dialog
  id="fc-subscribe-dialog"
  class="fc-dialog"
  aria-labelledby="fc-sub-title"
  aria-describedby="fc-sub-desc"
>
  <div class="fc-dialog-inner">
    <button
      type="button"
      class="fc-dialog-close"
      data-close-dialog
      aria-label="Close subscription dialog"
    >
      &times;
    </button>

    <p class="fc-eyebrow fc-eyebrow--crimson" style="margin: 0 0 8px;">
      $0.00 / WEEK &middot; NO PAYWALL
    </p>
    <h2
      id="fc-sub-title"
      style="font-family: var(--fc-font-headline); font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.14; margin: 0 0 10px;"
    >
      You have reached your limit of 0 free indictments.
    </h2>
    <p
      id="fc-sub-desc"
      style="font-family: var(--fc-font-body); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.46; color: var(--fc-ink-secondary); margin: 0 0 16px;"
    >
      Every docket, fine ratio, and consent order on <strong>financialcrimes.fyi</strong> is
      permanently free &mdash; without admitting or denying wrongdoing.
    </p>

    <div
      style="margin: 0 0 14px; padding: 13px 14px; background: var(--fc-bg-newsprint); border: 1px solid var(--fc-rule-strong); font-family: var(--fc-font-sans); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5;"
    >
      <strong style="display: block; font-family: var(--fc-font-mono); font-size: 10.5px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; margin-bottom: 5px; color: var(--fc-accent-crimson);">
        SIGNING UP &middot; COMING SOON
      </strong>
      Daily morning digest sign-ups are coming soon. No account or newsletter form is active yet.
    </div>

    <div
      style="padding: 12px 14px; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid var(--fc-rule-column); font-family: var(--fc-font-sans); font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.48;"
    >
      <strong style="display: block; font-family: var(--fc-font-mono); font-size: 10.5px; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 4px;">
        FOLLOW VIA RSS TODAY
      </strong>
      Track every new dispatch immediately in any feed reader:
      <div style="margin-top: 10px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; align-items: center;">
        <a
          href="/rss.xml"
          class="fc-btn-slate"
          style="padding: 8px 13px; font-size: 11px;"
        >
          Open RSS Feed (/rss.xml) &rarr;
        </a>
        <button
          type="button"
          class="fc-btn-outline"
          data-close-dialog
          style="padding: 8px 12px; font-size: 11px;"
        >
          Keep Reading
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</dialog>

<dialog
  id="fc-tipline-dialog"
  class="fc-dialog"
  aria-labelledby="fc-tip-title"
  aria-describedby="fc-tip-desc"
>
  <div class="fc-dialog-inner">
    <button
      type="button"
      class="fc-dialog-close"
      data-close-dialog
      aria-label="Close tip line dialog"
    >
      &times;
    </button>

    <p class="fc-eyebrow" style="margin: 0 0 8px;">TIP LINE &middot; PUBLIC FILINGS ONLY</p>
    <h2
      id="fc-tip-title"
      style="font-family: var(--fc-font-headline); font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.15; margin: 0 0 10px;"
    >
      Send Us a Public Filing
    </h2>
    <p
      id="fc-tip-desc"
      style="font-family: var(--fc-font-body); font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.48; color: var(--fc-ink-secondary); margin: 0 0 16px;"
    >
      Spotted an unsealed indictment, consent order, or regulatory fine that belongs on Page One?
    </p>

    <div
      style="padding: 14px; background: var(--fc-bg-newsprint); border: 1px solid var(--fc-rule-strong); font-family: var(--fc-font-sans); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5;"
    >
      <strong style="display: block; font-family: var(--fc-font-mono); font-size: 10.5px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; margin-bottom: 5px; color: var(--fc-accent-crimson);">
        SENDING TIPS &middot; COMING SOON
      </strong>
      Public-filing tip submissions are coming soon. We only publish cases backed by official court
      dockets and primary regulatory orders.
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 14px; display: flex; justify-content: flex-end;">
      <button type="button" class="fc-btn-outline" data-close-dialog style="padding: 8px 14px; font-size: 11px;">
        Close
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
</dialog>
